# Terrain / iOS invariants

See [`apps/web/AGENTS.md`](../../apps/web/AGENTS.md) for general frontend rules.

- Document scroll lock: `html[data-terrain-shell]` sets `overflow: hidden` on html/body/#root — scroll only inside `main`
- Shell: `h-dvh`, flex column, `min-h-0` on scrollable `main`; no document page scroll
- Safe areas: `env(safe-area-inset-*)` on topbar, bottom nav, composer, sticky footer
- iOS keyboard: measure `visualViewport` (T0/T1/T2) before any layout fix — use `mobile-pwa-debug` command
- No global `position: fixed` hacks without diagnosis; no legacy AppShell on terrain routes
